h4. Tag aliases

An alias says two spellings are one tag: searching or adding either gets the other. The site keeps one canonical spelling, and every post carrying the old one is moved to it.

Aliases are made by proposing a [[help:bulk_update_requests|bulk update request]], or directly by Builders and above. Some aliases are declared by the site itself and reapplied after any rebuild.

An alias is a real edit to real posts, not a display trick, which is why it is reviewed.
